            <ArticleTitle>The Structural Origin of Electron Injection Enhancements with Fulleropyrrolidine Interlayers.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">1500852</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/admi.201500852</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The orientation of the substituent groups in a new class of work function modification layers, based on functionalized fulleropyrrolidines, is measured and found to directly account for the sign of the work function change.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
